==In popular culture==
*"[[Could You Please Oblige Us with a Bren Gun?]]" is a humorous song, written and composed in 1941 by [[Noël Coward]], that focuses on the shortages of equipment experienced by the [[Home Guard (United Kingdom)|Home Guard]] in Britain during the Second World War.

